  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Just when you finally took a week off to clear your head, your entire
    neighborhood got invaded. You wake up on a morning to find all movement blocked
    outside: exactly 960 bizarre dwarves have set up camp, turning your street into
    pure chaos.



    This isn''t just any regular invasion force. They are an aggressive
    syndicate of pushy salesmen roaming door-to-door non-stop. One tries to shove
    a rusty socket wrench through your peephole, while another frantically rings
    the doorbell trying to sell you a single, mismatched sock.



    With local
    authorities completely ignoring the situation, your vacation is officially ruined.
    For the next week, trapped inside your home, you must survive solely by striking
    absurd trades with these 960 relentless pushers. Because if you don''t answer
    the door, they start breaking your windows.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 441331b3a39ed40a68c34209c0b8348f, type: 2}
